重新学习怎么走路呢
learning to walk again.

169
00:08:15,340 --> 00:08:17,200
"伟大的妥协"是什么
What was the Great Compromise?

170
00:08:17,440 --> 00:08:18,980
除了让你搬进我家之外的吗
You mean besides you moving in with me?

171
00:08:19,980 --> 00:08:22,080
让美国设了参议院与众议院
It created the two houses of Congress.

172
00:08:24,060 --> 00:08:26,280
下一题 禁止贩卖
Next question: What was the movement

173
00:08:26,280 --> 00:08:28,480
与饮酒的运动叫什么
against the sale or drinking of alcohol called?

174
00:08:28,740 --> 00:08:29,480
大肠运动吗
The bowel movement?

175
00:08:30,940 --> 00:08:32,700
不 是禁酒运动啦
No, the temperance movement.

176
00:08:33,100 --> 00:08:34,420
也别再提厕所了
And don't mention the bathroom.

177
00:08:34,460 --> 00:08:36,600
之前经过那个不知以前产啥的小镇时
I've had to pee since we passed that last town

178
00:08:36,600 --> 00:08:37,780
我就想尿尿了
that used to make something.

179
00:08:38,820 --> 00:08:39,880
那就去上厕所啊
Just go to the bathroom.

180
00:08:39,940 --> 00:08:41,160
你是在怕什么啊
What are you so afraid of?

181
00:08:41,920 --> 00:08:42,880
那厕所啊
The bathroom.

182
00:08:43,880 --> 00:08:45,640
我愿意使用公厕
I will use a public bathroom.

183
00:08:45,900 --> 00:08:47,140
也愿意乘坐公共大巴
I will use a public bus.

184
00:08:47,320 --> 00:08:50,180
但我不愿意使用在公共大巴上的公厕
But I will not use the public bathroom on a public bus.

185
00:08:50,440 --> 00:08:51,080
下一题
Next card.

186
00:08:51,260 --> 00:08:52,820
不要 给我颗糖 我学够多了
No, give me a Twizzler. I know enough.

187
00:08:53,060 --> 00:08:54,620
不许吃糖 认真点读
No candy. Study harder.

188
00:08:54,720 --> 00:08:56,060
你绝对只能拿个"D"了
You're looking at a solid "D."

189
00:08:56,460 --> 00:08:58,380
我的分数得跟我的胸部大小一样啊
Well, my grades should match my boobs.

190
00:08:59,620 --> 00:09:00,820
下一题
Next question. Okay.

191
00:09:01,280 --> 00:09:03,060
美国宪法是在哪个城市诞生的
In what city was the constitution written?

192
00:09:03,840 --> 00:09:04,480
不知道
No idea.

193
00:09:05,880 --> 00:09:06,400
费城吗
Philadelphia?

194
00:09:06,980 --> 00:09:08,740
靠 我差点要回答这个呢
Oh, damn it, I almost said that.

195
00:09:08,840 --> 00:09:09,599
这么明显
It's right there.

196
00:09:09,599 --> 00:09:11,840
费城出产牛肉奶酪三明治
Philadelphia makes cheesesteaks.

197
00:09:11,840 --> 00:09:13,980
宪法很俗气[奶酪]
The constitution is cheesy.

198
00:09:14,740 --> 00:09:15,960
我为什么要质疑自己呢
Why do I doubt myself?

199
00:09:17,040 --> 00:09:18,220
还多远啊
How much further?

200
00:09:18,480 --> 00:09:20,500
我还以为罗德岛只是一个小州呢
I thought Rhode Island was supposed to be a tiny state.

201
00:09:20,540 --> 00:09:21,400
什么时候能下车啊
When are we stopping?

202
00:09:21,760 --> 00:09:23,640
得先经过克兰斯顿 普罗维登斯
Well, we have to pass Cranston, Providence,

203
00:09:23,660 --> 00:09:24,740
然后我们在霍普[希望]下车
and then our stop is Hope.

204
00:09:25,340 --> 00:09:28,320
麦克斯 你是在叫做"希望"的小镇出生的吗
Wait, Max, you were born in a town called "Hope"?

205
00:09:29,580 --> 00:09:30,840
在霍普[希望]之外
Well, just outside hope.

206
00:09:31,040 --> 00:09:32,280
也在成功与金钱之外
and success and money.

207
00:09:32,900 --> 00:09:34,160
好吧 我是没希望了
Well, there's no hope for me.

208
00:09:34,160 --> 00:09:36,140
真憋不住了 我要杀进去了
I have to pee so badly. I'm going in.

209
00:09:37,480 --> 00:09:38,460
把糖留下
Leave the Twizzlers.

210
00:09:38,700 --> 00:09:39,600
给 快读书
Here, study.

211
00:09:41,320 --> 00:09:42,400
天啊
Oh, my God.

212
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:45,400
你们知道马桶不是装饰物而已吧
You know the toilet isn't just there as a suggestion.

213
00:10:02,623 --> 00:10:03,960
东北高中
Wow, North East high.

214
00:10:03,960 --> 00:10:05,360
从没想过我会再踏足这里
Never thought I'd be here again.

215
00:10:06,020 --> 00:10:08,140
完全没勾起我任何回忆啊
This sure brings back no memories.

216
00:10:10,700 --> 00:10:11,740
挺有爱的
It's cute.

217
00:10:11,840 --> 00:10:14,540
资金不足公立学校风格的那种有爱法
You know, in an underfunded public school kind of way.

218
00:10:16,380 --> 00:10:18,516
等等 你是高中生吗
Wait, are you in high school?

219
00:10:18,516 --> 00:10:21,502
天啊 我简直是千年老妖
Oh, my God, I'm a hundred.

220
00:10:22,220 --> 00:10:23,240
就这里 2C教室
Oh, there it is, 2-C.

221
00:10:24,220 --> 00:10:24,860
等等
Hold on.

222
00:10:26,120 --> 00:10:27,160
为什么你把它们关起来了
Why are you covering those up?

223
00:10:27,240 --> 00:10:28,620
我化学能过都是靠它们的呢
They're the only reason I passed chemistry.

224
00:10:33,620 --> 00:10:34,660
麦克斯·布莱克
Max Black.

225
00:10:35,940 --> 00:10:36,940
哈克老师
Mr. Huck.

226
00:10:38,020 --> 00:10:38,980
我很惊讶
I'm surprised.

227
00:10:38,980 --> 00:10:40,480
惊讶我会来吗
That I showed up?

228
00:10:40,720 --> 00:10:41,840
不 惊讶你还活着
No, that you're alive.

229
00:10:43,640 --> 00:10:45,000
我也有同感 姐妹
You and me both, sister.

230
00:10:46,620 --> 00:10:48,120
想必你就是卡洛琳了
And you must be Caroline.

231
00:10:48,520 --> 00:10:49,860
你看起来就像是
Oh, you look just like the girls

232
00:10:49,860 --> 00:10:51,720
以前会被麦克斯恶整的那种姑娘
Max used to give wedgies to in the cafeteria.

233
00:10:53,420 --> 00:10:54,320
她现在还会呢
Still does.

234
00:10:55,900 --> 00:10:57,220
女士们 他叫赫克托
Oh, ladies, this is Hector.

235
00:10:57,840 --> 00:10:59,200
赫克托今天会跟我们一起考试
Hector will be joining us today,

236
00:10:59,200 --> 00:11:01,220
因为他考试时没有出席
as he was not in attendance during exam day.

237
00:11:01,980 --> 00:11:04,320
哈克老师 我迟到是因为我姐没叫我起床
Ay, yo, Mr. Huck, that's 'cause my sister didn't wake me up

238
00:11:04,400 --> 00:11:05,260
也因为她是个贱人
'cause she's a bitch.

239
00:11:08,420 --> 00:11:09,240
很好
Very good.

240
00:11:12,880 --> 00:11:14,620
这地儿咋这么多小桌子啊
This place is filled with tiny tables, yo.

241
00:11:16,920 --> 00:11:17,900
抱歉
Oh, I'm sorry.

242
00:11:18,060 --> 00:11:19,780
只有老师与小流氓们
It's teachers and delinquents only

243
00:11:19,780 --> 00:11:20,720
可越过此线
beyond this point.

244
00:11:21,120 --> 00:11:21,860
你可以在这里等
You can wait out there.

245
00:11:23,120 --> 00:11:24,800
-你紧张吗 -有一点
- Are you nervous? - A little.

246
00:11:25,040 --> 00:11:26,400
我忘了我包里有大麻烟
I forgot I have a joint in my purse,

247
00:11:26,400 --> 00:11:27,380
我可不想被老师开除啊
and I don't want to get expelled.

248
00:11:28,900 --> 00:11:30,340
麦克斯 你行的
Max, you can do this.

249
00:11:30,600 --> 00:11:32,200
我知道你觉得自己不行
I think you think you can't,

250
00:11:32,200 --> 00:11:33,720
但我知道你能行
but I know that you can.

251
00:11:34,240 --> 00:11:35,160
看着我
Look at me.

252
00:11:35,240 --> 00:11:37,060
你很聪明
You are smart.

253
00:11:37,960 --> 00:11:38,800
你是什么
What are you?

254
00:11:39,520 --> 00:11:39,920
聪明鬼
Smart.

255
00:11:40,320 --> 00:11:42,080
你看 你已经答对一题了
See, you already got one question right.

256
00:11:44,300 --> 00:11:45,480
好了 孩子们
Okay, kids,

257
00:11:45,540 --> 00:11:47,200
开始动脑筋吧[戴上思考之帽]
put on your thinking hats.

258
00:11:48,340 --> 00:11:50,460
我以为在教室不许戴帽子呢
Ay, yo, I thought we couldn't wear hats in the classroom.

259
00:11:53,420 --> 00:11:54,600
这句话我就当没听见
I'm going to ignore that,

260
00:11:54,600 --> 00:11:56,400
否则我会被你蠢哭的
because if I don't, I will weep.

261
00:11:57,860 --> 00:12:00,460
"1775年 保罗·里维尔警告哪两个人
"In 1775, Paul Revere warned which two men

262
00:12:00,460 --> 00:12:02,220
说英国人要来抓他们了"
that the British were coming to arrest them?"

263
00:12:02,220 --> 00:12:05,140
在野兽男孩的歌曲《保罗·里维尔》中
In the Beastie Boys song Paul Revere,

264
00:12:05,720 --> 00:12:07,760
保罗有一匹马和一夸脱啤酒
he had a horsie and a quart of beer.

265
00:12:08,660 --> 00:12:11,200
山姆·亚当斯是啤酒 如果喝太多
Sam Adams is a beer, and if you have too much,

266
00:12:11,220 --> 00:12:12,860
会醉到帮某个叫约翰的陌生男子打飞机
you end up giving a John a hancock.

267
00:12:13,480 --> 00:12:14,840
所以答案是山姆·亚当斯和约翰·汉考克
Sam Adams and John Hancock!

268
00:12:18,500 --> 00:12:21,680
我在等丙肝测试结果时都没这么紧张
I wasn't this nervous when I waited for the results of a hep C test.

269
00:12:23,800 --> 00:12:26,240
反正我也完全没学那玩意
Then again, I didn't study for that one at all.

270
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:30,180
我觉得我过了
Ay, yo, I think I nailed it.

271
00:12:30,500 --> 00:12:31,260
你挂了 赫克托
You failed, Hector.

272
00:12:33,000 --> 00:12:33,860
真的假的
For real?

273
00:12:34,220 --> 00:12:34,980
是真的
For really real.

274
00:12:35,840 --> 00:12:36,900
就连麦克斯好心
You even got the answer wrong

275
00:12:36,900 --> 00:12:39,020
大声说出来的答案 你都写错了
that Max so graciously said out loud.

276
00:12:41,880 --> 00:12:42,760
没关系啦 哈克老师
Aw, that's cool, Mr. Huck.

277
00:12:42,800 --> 00:12:43,640
再接再厉嘛
Next time, right?

278
00:12:44,820 --> 00:12:45,340
是啊
Sure.

279
00:12:49,400 --> 00:12:52,200
麦克斯 很抱歉
Max, I'm sorry to tell you that...

280
00:12:53,580 --> 00:12:54,820
我不该质疑你的
I was wrong to doubt you.

281
00:12:55,660 --> 00:12:56,360
你的成绩是"B"
You got a "B."

282
00:12:56,880 --> 00:12:57,420
你过了
You passed.

283
00:12:58,400 --> 00:13:00,200
你个爱说谎的死老头
You lying son of a bitch.

284
00:13:02,220 --> 00:13:03,160
是真的 麦克斯
It's true, Max.

285
00:13:03,420 --> 00:13:05,060
老实说 我前后看了三遍
In fact, I went over it three times

286
00:13:05,060 --> 00:13:06,220
以确保不是我发疯
to make sure I wasn't insane.

287
00:13:07,900 --> 00:13:10,020
你那位朋友用来帮你的那些方法
Whatever that friend of yours there did to help you,

288
00:13:10,020 --> 00:13:10,760
的确奏效了
it really worked.

289
00:13:12,300 --> 00:13:14,960
抱歉 但我实在不能在外面站着了
I'm sorry, but I can't stand out there any longer.

290
00:13:15,040 --> 00:13:17,920
不少高一新生得了会对我"起立"敬礼的传染病
I've caused a small pandemic of erections in freshman boys.

291
00:13:19,160 --> 00:13:20,840
我过了 我得了个B
I passed! I got a "B"!

292
00:13:21,320 --> 00:13:23,120
我的分数跟你的咪咪大小一样
Now my grade matches your boobs!

293
00:13:24,560 --> 00:13:26,140
我要拿到我不在乎的
I'm getting that stupid diploma

294
00:13:26,140 --> 00:13:27,340
那个白痴毕业证了
I said I didn't care about.

295
00:13:31,280 --> 00:13:33,520
麦克斯 除了拿学位证 你还可以干别的呢
You can do more than get that diploma, Max.

296
00:13:34,360 --> 00:13:35,520
明天就是毕业典礼 如果你在这过夜
Graduation is tomorrow, and if you stay overnight,

297
00:13:35,540 --> 00:13:36,880
明早可以和同学们一起参加典礼
you can walk with the class in the morning.

298
00:13:38,880 --> 00:13:39,600
好啊
Uh, yes.

299
00:13:40,900 --> 00:13:42,860
你居然想去参加毕业典礼
You want to go to graduation?

300
00:13:43,600 --> 00:13:44,920
你太有我的风范了
That's so me of you.

301
00:13:46,080 --> 00:13:48,160
我一个学渣拿出了学霸的魄力
Well, I busted my "A" to get that "B,"

302
00:13:48,160 --> 00:13:49,436
我当然得享受全套服务啦
and I want to get the whole package.

303
00:13:49,436 --> 00:13:50,400
太好了
That's great.

304
00:13:50,400 --> 00:13:52,782
那我们明早10点见
Well, we'll see you tomorrow at 10:00 A.M.

305
00:13:53,160 --> 00:13:54,560
赫克托 那我们就在你平时让陌生人
And, Hector, we'll see you in front of the Am/Pm

306
00:13:55,200 --> 00:13:56,220
给你买啤酒的那个便利店门口见啦
asking strangers to buy you beer?

307
00:14:04,920 --> 00:14:06,980
床归我 桌子归你
I call the bed. You can have the table.

308
00:14:08,180 --> 00:14:09,140
麦克斯 这床太小了
Max, that bed is so tiny,

309
00:14:09,140 --> 00:14:10,120
咱俩得抱着睡了
we're gonna have to spoon.

310
00:14:10,580 --> 00:14:12,220
这房间唯一有可能出现抱抱的情况
The only spoon that's ever been in this room

311
00:14:12,220 --> 00:14:13,540
是起火后 我们抱着跳出火堆
was hovering over a flame.

312
00:14:15,300 --> 00:14:16,600
这房间蛮可爱的
Well, it's cute.

313
00:14:16,840 --> 00:14:20,440
虽然我来这之前没有打预防疫苗 但
I'm not vaccinated for anything in here, but...

314
00:14:20,440 --> 00:14:21,060
这里蛮可爱的
it's cute.

315
00:14:26,200 --> 00:14:27,020
还很"安全"
And safe.

316
00:14:29,000 --> 00:14:29,920
是啊 这里有有线电视
Yeah, they have cable,

317
00:14:30,060 --> 00:14:31,560
房间也可以按小时租
and you can rent rooms by the hour,

318
00:14:31,600 --> 00:14:33,420
所以我以前经常跟一个叫小麻吉的妓女
so I used to come here to watch Sex and The City

319
00:14:33,420 --> 00:14:35,200
来这里看《欲望都市》
with a prostitute named Tiny Marge.

320
00:14:35,960 --> 00:14:37,920
她会给我带香蕉面包 然后我们一起玩
She'd bring me banana bread and hang out.

321
00:14:37,940 --> 00:14:38,540
真欢乐
It was fun.

322
00:14:39,640 --> 00:14:40,499
这下可好
Oh, great.

323
00:14:40,499 --> 00:14:42,510
这里居然没有咖啡机
There's no coffeemaker.

324
00:14:45,320 --> 00:14:46,760
算了 我找到了
Never mind, found it.

325
00:14:48,240 --> 00:14:50,680
你以前来这里 你妈不会担心吗
Your mom wasn't worried when you'd come down here?

326
00:14:51,040 --> 00:14:51,480
不会啊
No.

327
00:14:51,700 --> 00:14:53,480
她还有点嫉妒 因为
She was a little jealous that I was hanging out

328
00:14:53,480 --> 00:14:56,180
我跟小麻吉玩不带她 但...
with Tiny Marge without her, but...

329
00:14:56,180 --> 00:14:58,860
我妈唯一担心的也只有...她自己
The only thing my mom ever worried about was herself.

330
00:15:00,300 --> 00:15:01,260
她很 自私
She's selfish.

331
00:15:02,280 --> 00:15:03,920
她因为"有事"
She missed my birth

332
00:15:04,200 --> 00:15:05,280
错过了我的出生
'cause she "had a thing."

333
00:15:06,120 --> 00:15:08,260
拜托 她不可能这么糟糕
Come on, she can't be that bad.

334
00:15:08,620 --> 00:15:11,280
而且事实证明 你不算是高中辍学的学渣
Turns out, you're not that big of a high school dropout,

335
00:15:11,320 --> 00:15:13,320
所以你妈可能也不是一个人渣
and she's probably not that big of a monster.

336
00:15:13,420 --> 00:15:15,460
至少她独自抚养你 没把你弄死啊
I mean, she raised you alone, and you didn't die.

337
00:15:15,640 --> 00:15:17,140
其实我都死过两次了
I did actually, twice.

338
00:15:17,400 --> 00:15:19,840
但帮她说句公道话 那两次她都不在
But in fairness to her, she wasn't there either time.

339
00:15:20,820 --> 00:15:22,720
麦克斯 你何不请她来参加你的毕业典礼
Max, why don't you invite her to your graduation?

340
00:15:22,960 --> 00:15:24,460
别告诉我你没她电话
And don't say you don't have her number.

341
00:15:24,460 --> 00:15:27,040
你手机里那个"爬出她洞洞"的联系人就是她
I know it's in your phone under "lady I came out of."

342
00:15:28,360 --> 00:15:31,380
我还知道在你手机里 我的称呼是"屁精"
I also know I'm in your phone as "fart monster."

343
00:15:32,120 --> 00:15:33,840
那是因为我认识三个卡洛琳 要区分
That's because I know, like, three Carolines.

344
00:15:34,740 --> 00:15:36,020
-胡说 -被你发现了
- No, you don't. - Busted.

345
00:15:36,940 --> 00:15:39,200
我来打 你来留口讯
Here, I'll dial, You just leave the message.

346
00:15:39,700 --> 00:15:41,100
-给 -不要
- Here. - No!

347
00:15:41,320 --> 00:15:42,360
-麦克斯 -屁精
- Max! - Fart monster!

348
00:15:43,100 --> 00:15:43,920
听话
Just do it.

349
00:15:43,940 --> 00:15:45,900
明天你看见她一定会很高兴的
You'll be so happy when you see her there tomorrow.

350
00:15:45,900 --> 00:15:47,140
提前是我们能活过今晚
If we live through the night.

351
00:15:49,380 --> 00:15:50,718
是我 麦克斯
Hey, it's me, Max.

352
00:15:50,718 --> 00:15:53,580
那个棕色头发 在你肚子里只住了7个半月
Brown hair, lived in you for 7 1/2 months

353
00:15:53,580 --> 00:15:55,100
就因为你眼瞎不会看香烟盒上的警告
due to your inability to read the warnings

354
00:15:55,100 --> 00:15:56,000
而被赶出来的人
on the side of cigarettes.

355
00:15:57,200 --> 00:15:59,660
听着 明天是我高中毕业典礼
Listen, I'm graduating from high school tomorrow,

356
00:15:59,660 --> 00:16:02,440
如果你不忙着从炉子底下找药片
so if you're not busy looking for pills under the stove

357
00:16:02,440 --> 00:16:04,417
或抓邻居家的猫去换酒钱的话
or selling the neighbor's cat for beer money,

358
00:16:04,417 --> 00:16:06,220
就过来看看吧
why don't you come?

359
00:16:06,220 --> 00:16:06,700
麦克斯
Max!

360
00:16:06,880 --> 00:16:08,580
干嘛 那只是草稿啦
What? That was a first draft.

361
00:16:08,860 --> 00:16:09,860
按3号键 删除 重录
Hit three, delete, rerecord.

362
00:16:11,760 --> 00:16:13,080
是我 麦克斯
Hey, it's me, Max.

363
00:16:13,580 --> 00:16:16,380
明天我要去高中领毕业证
Look, I'm getting my degree tomorrow at the high school.

364
00:16:16,620 --> 00:16:18,800
地点就在你喝酒的那间酒吧
You know, that's the building between the bar you drink at

365
00:16:18,800 --> 00:16:20,840
和你"跳舞"的那间酒吧之间
and the bar you dance at, so...

366
00:16:20,840 --> 00:16:21,720
按3号键 删除 重录
Hit three, delete, rerecord.

367
00:16:23,580 --> 00:16:24,440
我是麦克斯
Hey, it's Max.

368
00:16:24,940 --> 00:16:26,960
明天是我的高中毕业典礼
I'm graduating from high school tomorrow.

369
00:16:27,140 --> 00:16:28,660
时间是早上10点 希望你赏光
If you can make it, it starts at 10:00.

370
00:16:29,120 --> 00:16:30,000
再见
Okay, bye.

371
00:16:31,120 --> 00:16:32,580
瞧 不是很难[硬]吧
See, that wasn't hard.

372
00:16:32,940 --> 00:16:35,680
这床被子是 但打电话不是
This duvet is, but that wasn't.

373
00:16:40,500 --> 00:16:42,160
为什么帽子上就一个流苏穗呢
How come they only give you one of these?

374
00:16:44,680 --> 00:16:46,420
麦克斯 要不你还是别说话了
Okay, Max, maybe don't say anything else,

375
00:16:46,420 --> 00:16:47,660
我怕他们把毕业证收回去
or they'll take your diploma back.

376
00:16:49,380 --> 00:16:50,900
好了 毕业生们 时间到
Okay, graduates, it's time.

377
00:16:50,900 --> 00:16:52,400
大家按字母顺序排队
Everyone line up alphabetically,

378
00:16:52,400 --> 00:16:53,620
出发去礼堂吧
and let's make our way.

379
00:16:54,480 --> 00:16:56,240
恭喜
Oh, and congratulations.

380
00:16:57,420 --> 00:16:58,740
你做到了
You did it.

381
00:17:01,020 --> 00:17:03,420
麦克斯 长袍加身的你看着好聪明呀
Max, you look so smart in that robe.

382
00:17:04,020 --> 00:17:04,880
其实没有啦
I'm not that smart.

383
00:17:04,900 --> 00:17:06,980
我刚发现原来袍子里面是要穿衣服的
I just found out you're supposed to wear clothes under this thing.

384
00:17:11,100 --> 00:17:12,420
麦克斯 我从未问过你
Max, I never asked you.

385
00:17:12,480 --> 00:17:14,060
你离毕业证只差一场考试
You were so close to getting your diploma.

386
00:17:14,140 --> 00:17:15,580
你为什么不去参加呢
Why didn't you take that test?

387
00:17:15,700 --> 00:17:17,200
我本来想去的 但我妈
I was going to, but my mother

388
00:17:17,200 --> 00:17:19,280
那天不让我去上学 非要拉我去逛百货
kept me out of school that day to go to the mall.

389
00:17:20,060 --> 00:17:21,560
在期末考试那天吗
On finals day?

390
00:17:21,840 --> 00:17:24,420
是不是雷文·西蒙尼大驾光临你们的百货
Was there at least a special appearance By Raven-Symone?

391
00:17:26,380 --> 00:17:28,780
有名气的好人不会来这里
No one good ever came here.

392
00:17:29,480 --> 00:17:32,020
就像我妈今天不会来一样
Just like my mother didn't come here today.

393
00:17:32,620 --> 00:17:34,420
还有时间 或许她会来
There's still time. Maybe she'll come.

394
00:17:34,780 --> 00:17:35,080
或许吧
Maybe.

395
00:17:36,060 --> 00:17:37,640
我毕业典礼时 我爸也迟到了
I mean, my dad was late to my graduation

396
00:17:37,640 --> 00:17:39,320
因为他的直升飞机要加油
because his helicopter needed to refuel.

397
00:17:41,100 --> 00:17:43,040
是啊 我妈可能也碰到这种情况了
Yeah, that's probably what happened to my mom.

398
00:17:44,140 --> 00:17:47,400
但她的那架飞"鸡"可能已经睡死在她身上了
But her helicopter's probably passed out on top of her.

399
00:17:51,080 --> 00:17:53,840
我从未像今天这般自信
I have never been more confident,

400
00:17:53,840 --> 00:17:58,380
因为今天我站在这里 看着你们大家
because as I stand here and look out at all of you today...

401
00:17:58,380 --> 00:18:00,160
我以前也是致词的优秀毕业生
I was my class valedictorian.

402
00:18:01,000 --> 00:18:03,680
我意识到 没人可以阻挡我们前进
I realize nobody can stop us.

403
00:18:03,900 --> 00:18:05,080
是啊 我也曾天真如你
Mm-hmm, yeah, I thought that too.

404
00:18:07,040 --> 00:18:09,200
我们就是未来
We are the future.

405
00:18:09,740 --> 00:18:12,220
没错 等10年后你得在大巴上尿尿就梦醒了
Sure we are, until you have to pee on a bus in ten years.

406
00:18:19,260 --> 00:18:19,980
谢谢 艾米
Thank you, Amy.

407
00:18:20,880 --> 00:18:23,040
我"不敢想象"在接下来的4年里
It's hard to imagine not hearing that voice

408
00:18:23,040 --> 00:18:25,060
我每天都听不到这声音了
every day for the next four years.

409
00:18:26,460 --> 00:18:27,500
谢谢
Thank you.

410
00:18:33,200 --> 00:18:36,080
那个 那个 麦克斯的妈妈
Hi, Mrs.--Ms.-- Max's mom.

411
00:18:36,720 --> 00:18:38,840
我是卡洛琳·钱宁 你女儿麦克斯的
This is Caroline Channing, your daughter Max's

412
00:18:38,840 --> 00:18:40,880
好友兼室友兼生意伙伴
best friend and roommate and business partner.

413
00:18:41,880 --> 00:18:43,780
虽然我很不想给你留言
I didn't want to leave this on a voice mail,

414
00:18:43,900 --> 00:18:46,200
但你居然缺席自己女儿的毕业典礼
but I cannot believe you didn't show up

415
00:18:46,200 --> 00:18:47,460
这种行为让我无法理解
to your own daughter's graduation

416
00:18:47,460 --> 00:18:50,560
而且你还是害她当年没能毕业的罪魁祸首
When you are the sole reason she didn't graduate in the first place.

417
00:18:50,760 --> 00:18:53,400
谁会期末考试那天 带女儿去逛百货啊
I mean, who takes their daughter to the mall on finals day?

418
00:18:53,400 --> 00:18:54,580
有你这么当妈的吗
What kind of mother are you?

419
00:18:54,780 --> 00:18:56,820
一直以来我都在麦克斯面前帮你说话
And all the times I've defended you to Max--

420
00:18:56,920 --> 00:18:58,840
我不是在夸自己 但我的确常常
not to make it about me, but it was a lot--

421
00:18:59,700 --> 00:19:01,880
说"她其实没那么糟糕啦"
saying, "She's not that bad. She's not that bad."

422
00:19:01,880 --> 00:19:04,000
但你的确就是这么糟糕 麦克斯说得对
Well, I guess you are that bad. Max is right.

423
00:19:04,020 --> 00:19:05,200
你是个人渣
You are a monster.

424
00:19:06,760 --> 00:19:08,360
如果你已经在路上了 那我们在第2排等你哦
If you're on your way, we're in the second row.

425
00:19:08,460 --> 00:19:09,040
我是金色头发那个
I have blonde hair.

426
00:19:16,649 --> 00:19:18,763
克里斯蒂娜·拜尔斯
Christina Bayers.

427
00:19:19,480 --> 00:19:21,420
那是我孙女
Whoo, that's my granddaughter!

428
00:19:28,280 --> 00:19:30,520
萨拉查·贝尔蒙特
Salazar Belmonte.

429
00:19:33,100 --> 00:19:34,240
那是我儿子
That's my boy!

430
00:19:35,774 --> 00:19:37,905
麦克斯·布莱克
Max Black.

431
00:19:42,580 --> 00:19:44,618
麦克斯·布莱克
Max Black.

432
00:19:53,339 --> 00:19:55,542
她是我楼下的邻居
That's my downstairs neighbor!

433
00:20:09,576 --> 00:20:11,460
所以你打电话把他们都叫来了
So what, you called them all?

434
00:20:11,460 --> 00:20:13,320
是啊 以防万一嘛
Yeah, you know, just in case.

435
00:20:13,940 --> 00:20:15,180
麦克斯 我错了 你是对的
Max, you were right, and I was wrong.

436
00:20:15,280 --> 00:20:17,020
你妈真的就像你说的那样糟
Your mother's really as bad as you said.

437
00:20:17,020 --> 00:20:19,620
其实没那么坏啦
Mm, oh, it's not that bad.

438
00:20:19,620 --> 00:20:20,320
怎么不是了
What do you mean?

439
00:20:20,400 --> 00:20:22,200
明明是她在期末考试时带你去逛百货
She took you to the mall on finals day.

440
00:20:22,320 --> 00:20:24,980
是啊 但那天是我们过得最开心的一天
Yeah, but it was the greatest day we ever had.

441
00:20:25,340 --> 00:20:26,560
我们买了冰淇淋
We got ice cream,

442
00:20:26,800 --> 00:20:29,060
我们坐在超市的按摩椅上吃
we ate it in the massage chairs at Brookstone,

443
00:20:29,120 --> 00:20:30,680
然后有个小孩掉进喷泉
And then a kid fell in the fountain,

444
00:20:30,680 --> 00:20:31,900
我们都快笑死了
and we died laughing.

445
00:20:32,880 --> 00:20:34,760
哪天都能高中毕业
Well, I guess you can graduate high school any day,

446
00:20:34,760 --> 00:20:35,960
但看到小孩差点淹死
but you can only watch a kid

447
00:20:35,960 --> 00:20:37,580
这种好事可不是天天有
almost drown in a fountain once.

448
00:20:38,120 --> 00:20:40,240
她今天不来没关系
It is okay that she wasn't there today,

449
00:20:40,240 --> 00:20:41,000
因为你来了
because you were.

450
00:20:41,760 --> 00:20:43,540
而且如果没有你推我一把
And none of this would have been possible

451
00:20:43,540 --> 00:20:44,960
这一切都不可能发生
if you hadn't pushed me.

452
00:20:45,040 --> 00:20:47,020
当然如果不是我推了那小孩一把
And that kid wouldn't have almost drowned

453
00:20:47,020 --> 00:20:48,360
他也不会差点淹死
if I hadn't pushed him.

454
00:20:50,200 --> 00:20:50,780
还是稍有区别的吧
Little different.

455
00:20:51,880 --> 00:20:54,260
总而言之 你对我有信心
Bottom line, you had faith in me

456
00:20:54,260 --> 00:20:56,740
就像托马斯·杰斐逊相信路易斯和克拉克一样
like Thomas Jefferson had faith in Lewis and Clark.

457
00:20:58,820 --> 00:20:59,860
天啊
Oh, no.

458
00:21:00,420 --> 00:21:02,580
现在你俩都是死书呆了
Now you're both nerds!
